R  THE ROOT CAUSE: what the corpus m2l_disk values are
======================================================================================================================
  [PASS] R1 the corpus m2l_disk is a KINEMATIC fit: log-correlation with the Newtonian no-dark-matter ratio exceeds 0.8
         measured: r = 0.918 over 175 SPARC galaxies; median corpus/Newtonian = 0.66; corpus median 1.17, max 15.3
         reading:  a 3.6-micron population ratio is set by photometry (0.5-0.7) and would not track the kinematics at r = 0.92

